{"list_html":"  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Rodl_200kb-1.jpg\"\n          alt=\"R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;It\u2019s truly a great place to work, as our employees tell us every day&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicola_Lohrey_Rodl_Partner_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicola Lohrey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicola Lohrey<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Managing Partner - R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Horus_Pharma_2_200KB.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Horus Pharma offices fitted out by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;At the beginning of the project, there were many concerns among our employees. But as soon as they stepped into the new offices, those concerns quickly disappeared. They immediately realized that every aspect of the space had been thoughtfully designed with their needs in mind&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Megane_Jeanson_Horus_Pharma_200kb.png\" alt=\"Megane Jeanson\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Megane Jeanson<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Head of Facilities Management \u2013 Horus Pharma<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Merz_Aesthetics_1_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Merz Aesthetics fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We even invited our European colleagues to visit, and they were envious of our offices, which now serve as a benchmark for other Merz Aesthetics subsidiaries across Europe&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicolas_de_La_Hosseraye_Merz_Aesthetics_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicolas de La Hosseraye\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicolas de La Hosseraye<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Merz Aesthetics<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;It gave IM Projet\u2019s image a huge boost. We no longer hesitate to invite external visitors\u2014it\u2019s really fantastic&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Geoffrey-Julien-IM-Projet.png\" alt=\"Geoffrey Julien\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Geoffrey Julien<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Engineer \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Vanderlande_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Vanderlande fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We now have a completely different dynamic. The cafeteria is used far more than before, becoming a social hub where people play foosball and enjoy the available amenities. It really makes coming back to the office something to look forward to&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Christophe_Jallon_Vanderlande.png\" alt=\"Christophe Jallon\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Christophe Jallon<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Vanderlande<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Groupe_Pharma_3_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"A pharmaceutical group&#039;s fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Employees really appreciate the new workplace and make full use of it. They now have access to spaces they had never experienced before and that were not available in our previous offices. The result speaks for itself\u2014a successful transformation&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Office_manager_Groupe_Pharmaceutique_200kb.png\" alt=\"Confidential\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Confidential<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Office Manager \u2013 Pharmaceutical Group<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n","pagination_html":"    <nav class=\"block-11-1-reviews__pagination\" aria-label=\"Testimonials pagination\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--prev\" data-page=\"2\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&larr;<\/span> Previous        <\/button>\n      \n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"1\">1<\/button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"2\">2<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">3<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"4\">4<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"9\">9<\/button>\n              \n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--next\" data-page=\"4\">\n          Next <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;<\/span>\n        <\/button>\n          <\/nav>\n    ","paged":3,"total_pages":9,"total":53}